  ['solid arrow — the part that DRIVES; dashed — the motion that follows']: 'flèche pleine — la pièce qui COMMANDE ; pointillé — le mouvement qui suit',
  ['schematic — stone (ruby) in its fork arm (steel), tooth (brass); faces are solved, not drawn (makePalletFork)']: 'schéma — palette (rubis), bras d’ancre (acier), dent (laiton) ; faces résolues, pas dessinées (makePalletFork)',
  ['p (beat)']: 'p (cycle)',
  ['+12°']: '+12°',
  ['0°']: '0°',
